.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt KEXTSTAT 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm kextstat
.Nd list the loaded kernel extensions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl k
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl b Ar bundle_id ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
lists the kernel extensions the kernel has loaded, in load order: their
index, how many others refer to them, their load address, size and wired
size, identifier, version and UUID, and the indexes of the extensions they
are linked against.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl b Ar bundle_id
Only the extension with this identifier (repeatable).
.It Fl k
Leave out the kernel and its built-in components
.Pq Li com.apple.kpi.* , com.apple.kernel* .
.It Fl l
Leave out the header line.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr kextload 8 ,
.Xr kextunload 8
